            "text": " on a bed of shredded iceberg lettuce, served chilled with a lemon wedge. The sauce is made with mayonnaise, ketchup, a little Worcestershire sauce, and lemon juice. It takes fifteen minutes, needs no cooking, and is best made with the best prawns you can find."
